arrangement: why-reason-elide-cascaded
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- why-reason-elide-cascaded && mise run loom:promote -- why-reason-elide-cascaded`. `mise run loom:vars -- --all why-reason-elide-cascaded` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
